## P2 bundle

- **🇪🇺×5** → **🇷🇺 NEW (`…98`) `:8444`** → **🇩🇪 Brain** Contabo egress  
- **🌏×5** → **🇷🇺 NEW (`…98`) `:8445`** → hop → **🇸🇬 SG Contabo (`…78`)** egress  
- **🇷🇺 MAIN — FirstVDS / Аладдин (`…180`)** VPN entry **не трогаем**
